      "created_at": "2019-12-11T02:27:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A d8 lieutenant has a freeze ray gun. The effect from a blast is to encase the poor hero in a block of ice, unable to move.</p>\n<p>How do you write up that ability? What is the mechanic for such an effect?</p>",
