      "username": "Sea-Envy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-12-11T03:49:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That would probably be a normal HINDER action. Completely preventing all action dose not work so well in this system but giving a minus to an action that makes it inefective works well.</p>\n<p>We do not have the full preiveiw of lieutenant and villain creation yet so that might have better advice and more rules for lieutenants that are good at one basic action&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
