      "username": "catDreaming",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-12-11T05:19:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'd say the lieutenant could have a +2 bonus on Hinders using the freeze gun. That would emulate the hero having to spend their turn struggling to break free of the ice.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, the lieutenant could have a +2 bonus on Overcomes using the freeze gun. Each success on a given hero creates an \"Ice Prison\" challenge which has 1 box. Each Ice Prison on a hero gives them a -1 persistent penalty on all Actions.</p>",
